    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n** THIS PROPERTY IS NOT SUITABLE FOR MORTGAGE, CASH BUYERS ONLY **\n\nAn exceptional fully refurbished detached 3-Bedroom Bungalow in a Secluded Woodland Setting comes new to the market.Presented in truly turnkey condition, this beautiful property offers an exceptional opportunity to acquire a stylish, energy-efficient home in a peaceful setting, while enjoying the convenience of an abundance of local amenities on its doorstep.The property has undergone a comprehensive refurbishment to an exceptionally high standard, resulting in an impressive B1 Building Energy Rating. Significant energy efficiency upgrades include newly installed photovoltaic (PV) solar panels with water inverter and connected to the national electricity grid, a complete electrical rewire with certification, pumped cavity wall insulation, and a newly re-insulated attic, ensuring lower running costs and year-round comfort.The luxurious refurbishment continues throughout the interior with new wood flooring, fresh décor throughout, a contemporary bathroom suite, a newly fitted kitchen complete with high-end integrated appliances, new blackout blinds throughout, and a modern security alarm system to mention just a few, creating a home that is ready for immediate occupation with no further investment required.Externally, the property enjoys a generous patio area to the front, ideal for outdoor dining and entertaining and an open green area also to the front together with a rear garden area with plenty of privacy.The location is second to none. A leisurely two-minute walk brings you to a commuter bus stop and The Village Hotel, renowned for its bar and restaurant. The vibrant seaside village of Bettystown, with its beautiful beach and excellent range of shops, cafés and amenities, is just 1.5km away. Drogheda town centre and Junction 7 of the M1 motorway are both within a comfortable 10-minute drive, making this an ideal location for commuters.This outstanding home is perfectly suited to a young family, professionals or those looking to downsize, with an excellent range of nearby amenities including schools, a crèche/childcare facility, public transport links, and Laytown & Bettystown Golf & Tennis Club for the sporting enthusiast.Viewing is highly recommended strictly by appointment with sole agents Sherry FitzGerald Lannon."
      },
