        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 2.30 x 1.40\n\n\nLiving/Dining - 4.80 x 4.90\n\n\nKitchen - 3.10 x 2.20\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.40 x 2.50\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.10 x 2.50\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.35 x 2.20\n\n\nBathroom - 2.50 x 2.50\n\n\nUtility - 1.55 x 1.10\n\n\nStore - 1.20 x 0.70\n\n\nTOTAL: - Approx. 68 SqM/735 SqFt\n\n\n"
      },
