        "Content": "<ul><li>B1 Building Energy Rating</li><li>Turn-key condition</li><li>Gas central heating with zoned heating controls</li><li>Complete luxury refurbishment throughout</li><li>PV solar panels connected to National Grid also</li><li>Full new Kitchen fit-out and appliances</li><li>Full new Bathroom fit-out</li><li>TRV's fitted to all radiators</li><li>All new laminate wood flooring</li><li>Fully painted throughout</li><li>New curtains throughout</li><li>New black-out window blinds throughout</li><li>Fully rewired throughout and certified</li><li>Pumped cavity insulation to all external walls</li><li>Attic space fully reinsulated</li><li>New double doors and window to Living area</li><li>New Phonewatch security alarm system</li><li>Management fee 900 per annum</li><li>2 minute walk to Bus Stop and The Village Hotel</li><li>1km from Tesco and Lidl</li><li>1.5km from Bettystown village and beach</li><li>Close to all local amenities and schools</li><li>10 minute drive to Drogheda</li><li>Less than 30 minute drive to Dublin Airport</ul>"
